      "latex": "\\text{M.D}=\\dfrac{\\sum f|x-\\bar{x}|}{\\sum f}\\ \\text{ where, }\\ \\bar{x}=\\dfrac{\\sum fx}{\\sum f}=\\dfrac{5879}{40}=146.975",
